  actor: jgstern_agent  # 096a
  clock: 3  # 096a
  nonce: 096a  # 096a
  message: "Fixed in PR (dev 1a3e9ebf47).\n\nBehavioral evidence: analyze_perl on merged dev, a repo holding a decoy `package Decoy; sub get { } sub go { }`:\n  HTTP::Tiny->new->get($u)                  -> perl:HTTP::Tiny:0-0:get:unresolved (method); was: Decoy::get (receiver-blind)\n  my $ua = LWP::UserAgent->new; $ua->get($u) -> perl:LWP::UserAgent:0-0:get:unresolved (method)\n  $obj->go (untyped)                         -> perl:external:0-0:go:unresolved (method); was: Decoy::go\n  top level: my $t = Decoy->new; $t->go      -> main.pl -> Decoy::go (method); was: no edge (no caller)\nProduction-path tests: test_perl_expression_invocant.py.\n\nFix: an expression invocant is typed only where the file states it:\n- Pkg->new (only `new` constructs; DBI->connect returns a handle);\n- a scalar assigned one;\n- the method invocant, i.e. $self/$this/$class taken by shift or as the first of @_, or a bare shift->m outside main. It is the enclosing package.\nA typed call resolves like a class-method call (call_construct=method). An untyped one gets the external method edge, never a short-name bind. Top-level calls are attributed to the file.\n\nTyping by SHAPE was tried first and rejected on measurement: it typed a plain function's first argument, a second shift, and a $SIG{__DIE__} handler's argument as the enclosing package. 311 postgresql edges moved onto the wrong package; 5 after the name rule.\n\nCorpus (frozen copies, perl files), resolved calls vs dev:\n  postgresql +7,363 / -581\n  virtualbox +959 / -744\n  git +34 / -173\nThe removed edges are receiver-blind binds. 554 / 551 / 122 of them are now external method edges; the rest moved to the typed package. A 15-edge sample of the new resolutions was all correct.\n\nNOT measured: how many of the removed blind binds were correct. Some were, e.g. postgresql `$node->wait_for_catchup` where $node is a plain function's parameter: unique method name, untyped receiver. That recall was given up for WI-johib's rule, as this item's fix shape specified."  # 096a
